{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p6#b172", "text": "The sync tool isn't broken. It's being handed 81", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 6, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p6#b173", "text": "unanswerable questions.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 6, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p6#b174", "text": "Every attempt so far has switched on two-way sync across a", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 6, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p6#b175", "text": "tree that was already duplicated. rclone bisync in particular", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 6, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p6#b176", "text": "will either abort or start fighting itself when it meets pairs like", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 6, "type": "paragraph"}}
