{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b181", "text": "In plain terms: it isn't choking on a bug. It's choking on real", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b182", "text": "ambiguity it's being handed. Cleaning has to come before", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b183", "text": "connecting, and that ordering is the entire fix.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b184", "text": "This isn't a new plan, either. Your own 2026-08-11 handoff", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b185", "text": "already lays out the correct order — and flags that the job", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b186", "text": "never started:", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b187", "text": "1\nEnumerate — what belongs in each bucket (canonical,", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b188", "text": "empirical, corporate)", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b189", "text": "2\nDedup pass — collapse the identical and near-identical", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b190", "text": "copies", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b191", "text": "3\nKeyword sweep — catch anything missed under similar", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b192", "text": "terms", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b193", "text": "Every failed attempt has been an attempt at what comes after", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
