{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b203", "text": "fallen apart before, staged work with a check after each step is", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p7#b204", "text": "the cautious read — but that's your call, not mine.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 7, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b205", "text": "NOT STARTED", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b206", "text": "binaries in git", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b207", "text": "What to do with 421 MB of PDFs and an 81.6 MB zip", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b208", "text": "Raw binaries that large don't belong committed into a git repo.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b209", "text": "Git LFS, a .gitignore that keeps them Drive-only, or simply", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b210", "text": "accepting the bloat are all legitimate choices with real trade-", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b211", "text": "offs. Not a decision to be made silently on your behalf.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b212", "text": "OWED TO YOU", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b213", "text": "prompt caching", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b214", "text": "The prompt caching explanation", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b215", "text": "You said you read the handed-off caching doc and couldn't", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b216", "text": "make heads or tails of it. That's still outstanding, and", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b217", "text": "deliberately not attempted here — handing you a second dense", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b218", "text": "document about the first dense document would miss the point", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b219", "text": "entirely. When you want it, it gets read fresh from the current", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b220", "text": "official material and explained in the register of this report, not", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b221", "text": "that one.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b222", "text": "Glossary", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b223", "text": "Every term used above that assumed knowledge it had no business assuming.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b224", "text": "wake lock\nA request that stops the phone's processor from sleeping. It", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b225", "text": "does not stop Android from killing your app — which is the", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b226", "text": "whole misunderstanding behind the dropped session.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b227", "text": "phantom process killer\nA feature in Android 12 and later that hunts down", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b228", "text": "background processes started by apps like Termux and", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b229", "text": "terminates them, wake lock or no wake lock.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b230", "text": "$TMPDIR\nA scratch folder for temporary files. Anything in it can be", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b231", "text": "deleted at any moment without warning. Your handoffs were", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b232", "text": "living there.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p8#b233", "text": "md5 / checksum\nA short fingerprint calculated from a file's contents. Two files", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 8, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p9#b234", "text": "with the same fingerprint are identical byte for byte — which", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 9, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p9#b235", "text": "is how the duplicate PDFs were proven rather than guessed at.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 9, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p9#b236", "text": "fuse\nThe kind of filesystem Android uses for shared storage. It can't", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 9, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p9#b237", "text": "store Unix permission bits or symbolic links, which is why git", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 9, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p9#b238", "text": "needs special settings to live there.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 9, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p9#b239", "text": "rclone bisync\nTwo-way sync between a local folder and cloud storage,", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 9, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p9#b240", "text": "changes flowing in both directions. It's the mode that breaks", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 9, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p9#b241", "text": "when it finds files it can't tell apart.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 9, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p9#b242", "text": "source of truth\nThe one copy that wins when copies disagree. Without picking", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 9, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p9#b243", "text": "one, every sync is a coin flip. Yours is now the on-device vault.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 9, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p9#b244", "text": "git LFS\nAn add-on that stores large binary files outside the main", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 9, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p9#b245", "text": "repository so it doesn't balloon. The usual answer for PDFs", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 9, "type": "paragraph"}}
{"id": "nova-corpus-diagnostic#p9#b246", "text": "and zips in a repo.", "metadata": {"source": "nova-corpus-diagnostic", "page": 9, "type": "paragraph"}}
